WEBVTT

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:12.860
So we have not only Regina Gaes,
but King Leap, too?

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:17.420
I know Queen Labyrinth
is nearby, as well.

00:00:17.420 --> 00:00:21.220
We're just a big gathering
of Seven Crowns, aren't we?

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:44.050
When one chooses to end their own life
is not for anyone else to decide.

00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:50.290
Learn what the power of the gods can do!

00:02:46.100 --> 00:02:51.190
Menu 4 <b>  The Budding Detective
</b>~Mirror Glaze on the Mind~

00:02:56.880 --> 00:02:59.110
Nope! Nope! Nope! Nope! Nope!
Nope! Nope! Nope! Nope!

00:03:02.680 --> 00:03:03.630
Miss Karyl!

00:03:03.880 --> 00:03:08.700
This is why I said we shouldn't
bother with this quest, you jerk!

00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:15.870
Meep!

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:25.900
Come one, come all! We've got
low, low prices! Take a look!

00:03:26.180 --> 00:03:29.240
Li'l Ika has turned out
to be such a good son.

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:31.280
I don't know about that.

00:03:31.280 --> 00:03:33.060
Thanks a bunch!

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:35.430
Bro!

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:38.130
Hey, Charlie. Energetic as ever today, eh?

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:41.290
And your hairstyle is
on point as usual, bro!

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:43.190
Aw, stop.

00:03:43.190 --> 00:03:46.960
Anyway, seems Peco lady and her
buddies went to Monster Isle.

00:03:47.380 --> 00:03:49.070
And on that note...

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:51.070
We'll bring back a nice, big hunk of meat!

00:03:51.070 --> 00:03:52.870
Let's all have hotpot with it together!

00:03:52.870 --> 00:03:54.950
You can bring the vegetables!

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:56.860
That's what she said!

00:03:56.860 --> 00:03:57.990
For real?!

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:01.830
Okay, shop's closed for today!

00:04:01.830 --> 00:04:04.210
We'll have hotpot next time!
Come and have some!

00:04:04.210 --> 00:04:05.970
You imbeciles!

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.790
It's not even noon yet!

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:08.060
It'll be some kind of poultry, I bet!

00:04:08.060 --> 00:04:10.100
We get to eat some really good hotpot!
It'll be some kind of poultry, I bet!

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:10.730
The shop comes before hotpot!
It'll be some kind of poultry, I bet!

00:04:10.730 --> 00:04:11.510
The shop comes before hotpot!

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:29.240
Ah, there he is.

00:04:29.240 --> 00:04:31.860
I knew I wasn't mistaken.
It really was a person.

00:04:31.860 --> 00:04:34.350
That's some dopey look he's got on his face.

00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:36.950
Don't just live your life in a fog!

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:45.750
Please don't notice us...

00:04:45.750 --> 00:04:48.750
Oh, I hope my lord is all right...

00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:52.400
I'm worried about Yuuki, too,
but we're in trouble ourselves!

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:56.930
We came for some delicious meat, but the
only future I see has <i>us</i> as the meat!

00:04:56.930 --> 00:05:00.770
As long as the monster thinks I'm delicious,
I couldn't ask for more.

00:05:00.770 --> 00:05:01.600
That's scary!

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:04.140
Stop saying scary stuff and keep quiet!

00:05:08.540 --> 00:05:12.990
No! I'm done! I'm going home!

00:05:14.430 --> 00:05:16.580
Wolfen Bite!

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.590
What just happened?

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:28.710
I'm back.

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:30.370
Yuuki!
My lord!

00:05:32.840 --> 00:05:36.680
Ya got yer hair all messy again.

00:05:37.760 --> 00:05:40.270
Cut me some slack, princess!

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:44.770
Ya need ta look pretty.
Yer a girl, after all.

00:05:45.220 --> 00:05:46.880
Looks like none of you are hurt.

00:05:46.880 --> 00:05:49.520
Th-Thanks. You saved us.

00:05:49.520 --> 00:05:52.540
No problem. Us beastfolk
have got to stick together.

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:54.640
I'm Makoto.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.650
My name's Maho.

00:05:56.650 --> 00:05:57.800
I'm Kasumi.

00:05:57.800 --> 00:06:00.050
I work as a detective.

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:01.750
Now that I look at you guys,

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:04.010
you seem unfamiliar with this island.

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:06.290
Are you equipped well enough?

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:08.120
Exactly!

00:06:08.120 --> 00:06:12.000
Our guild's resident idiot brought us to
this island without doing any research first!

00:06:12.360 --> 00:06:15.140
Next thing you know,
we're lost, out of food,

00:06:15.140 --> 00:06:18.900
and passing out from hunger
at the worst possible moment!

00:06:19.350 --> 00:06:20.950
O-Okay...

00:06:20.950 --> 00:06:22.800
Well, you can relax now.

00:06:22.800 --> 00:06:25.030
Where's the rest of your group, anyway?

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:28.230
Oh, they said they were gonna
prepare a feast to thank you.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.710
Up we go! Hup!

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:36.490
Wow! You're pretty good, Peco!

00:06:36.490 --> 00:06:38.480
And you're excellent at the sanshin, Kaori!

00:06:38.480 --> 00:06:39.120
Huh?

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:40.230
I get it.

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:41.740
You're absolutely right.
That's the normal reaction.

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:44.100
It's all cooked up, golden
brown and tasty-looking!
You're absolutely right.
That's the normal reaction.

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:44.290
Yes!
You're absolutely right.
That's the normal reaction.

00:06:44.290 --> 00:06:44.650
Yes!

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:45.050
Look at all the juices
oozing out of the meat!

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:45.800
We're eating that?
Look at all the juices
oozing out of the meat!

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:46.030
Miss Pecorine!
We're eating that?
Look at all the juices
oozing out of the meat!

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:47.140
Look at all the juices
oozing out of the meat!
Miss Pecorine!

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:48.250
Miss Pecorine!

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:50.220
I found some tasty-looking bugs!

00:06:50.220 --> 00:06:51.870
Nice going, Kokkoro!

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.630
We'll use those as a secret seasoning!

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:56.640
Yay!

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:01.210
Don't get the wrong idea.
They're not trying to be mean.

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:05.180
That's genuinely how those
three express their gratitude.

00:07:05.180 --> 00:07:07.750
I know it's not what you want, but...

00:07:07.750 --> 00:07:08.890
Just give up.

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:12.660
Pri-Conne

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:15.540
Whew, that was delicious!

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:20.420
First experiences are
always mighty thrillin'.

00:07:20.980 --> 00:07:23.990
I feel like a new door has been opened...

00:07:25.060 --> 00:07:27.570
I'm so glad you're all happy!

00:07:27.570 --> 00:07:30.490
Do you ladies live on this island?

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:34.880
No, we're also residents of Landosol.

00:07:34.880 --> 00:07:40.400
We're the members of the guild Caon,
a vigilante team that protects beastfolk.

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:43.900
This island is inhabited by beastfolk,

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:47.590
but there have been many reported
sightings of Shadows recently.

00:07:47.590 --> 00:07:51.530
We're here because the beastfolk requested
that we investigate the island.

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:53.980
They're all the way out here, too?

00:07:53.980 --> 00:07:55.770
That is quite concerning.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:59.400
We've been investigating,

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:01.580
but we still can't find any answers.

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:04.690
As a detective,
this couldn't be more vexing.

00:08:07.900 --> 00:08:10.000
We'll help you!

00:08:10.440 --> 00:08:12.740
We've all eaten out of the same pot.

00:08:12.740 --> 00:08:15.340
Please allow the Gourmet Guild to help you,

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:17.380
so that everyone can eat in peace!

00:08:17.820 --> 00:08:18.890
Yeah!

00:08:20.020 --> 00:08:21.110
Thanks, guys.

00:08:21.360 --> 00:08:22.250
Of course!

00:08:24.430 --> 00:08:27.930
These are the spots we've found
where Shadows were seen.

00:08:27.930 --> 00:08:29.550
There are so many.

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:32.440
Kasumi found 'em all just by askin' around.

00:08:32.440 --> 00:08:33.860
That's remarkable.

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:36.430
T-To find something,
you have to get out and search.

00:08:36.430 --> 00:08:39.870
Finding the truth takes
hard work and patience.

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:41.070
That's a given!

00:08:41.070 --> 00:08:43.940
Okay, let's split up into
teams and investigate these.

00:08:43.940 --> 00:08:44.820
Right!

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:51.550
I never knew a monster could taste so good.

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:55.780
I believe there are all kinds of foods
out there just waiting to be discovered.

00:08:55.780 --> 00:08:59.690
Searching for them is what
the Gourmet Guild is all about.

00:08:59.690 --> 00:09:02.110
I see. That sounds fun.

00:09:02.110 --> 00:09:04.180
I wouldn't call it "gourmet,"

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:06.700
but the food at the pub my parents
own is pretty good, too.

00:09:06.700 --> 00:09:07.720
Really?

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:09.050
I'll treat you sometime.

00:09:10.600 --> 00:09:11.810
This is for me?

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:16.070
Yes. I do hope it pleases you.

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:19.710
It does! I'm happy!
You've made me so happy!

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:23.590
To receive something so beautiful
from Your Majesty...

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:27.510
I'm glad to hear that. Treasure it well.

00:09:35.500 --> 00:09:38.930
For crying out loud! Do you have
no sense of danger at all?!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:42.600
You're not gonna last if you're
so tense all the time.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:45.400
You oughta try smiling, Kasumi!

00:09:50.200 --> 00:09:50.790
Um... shouldn't we stop them?

00:09:50.790 --> 00:09:52.220
Let's go!
Um... shouldn't we stop them?

00:09:52.220 --> 00:09:52.810
Yeah!
Um... shouldn't we stop them?

00:09:52.810 --> 00:09:53.270
Let's go!
Um... shouldn't we stop them?

00:09:53.270 --> 00:09:54.050
Oh, they're fine.
Let's go!

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:54.990
Yeah!
Oh, they're fine.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:56.150
Kasumi does tend to push
herself too hard sometimes.
Think nothin'...

00:09:56.150 --> 00:09:57.680
...of it!
Kasumi does tend to push
herself too hard sometimes.

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.690
Kasumi does tend to push
herself too hard sometimes.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:03.940
Nothing unusual here, either.

00:10:03.940 --> 00:10:06.170
Assistant, finding anything over there?

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:07.640
Nothing!

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:08.860
Assistant?

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:13.660
Oh, he seemed deeply interested
in detective work.

00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:16.790
He wanted me to call him that
to get him in the mindset.

00:10:16.790 --> 00:10:18.050
I see.

00:10:20.260 --> 00:10:22.800
This was supposed to be the place...

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:37.780
Found them!

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:43.390
My lord!

00:10:47.150 --> 00:10:48.200
Watch out!

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:56.160
Here goes! Ryukyu-Ken Knuckle Arrow!

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:58.570
Thank you.

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:00.170
Think nothin' of it!

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:02.300
If I can capture a Shadow,

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:04.940
I'm sure it'll be the key
to solving the mystery!

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:18.700
Yes! If I can just keep—

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:27.890
I can feel my strength flowing through me...

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:28.950
This light...

00:11:29.340 --> 00:11:30.960
Is it Assistant's power?

00:11:45.630 --> 00:11:49.300
Never woulda expected
ta find so many of 'em.

00:11:49.300 --> 00:11:52.610
I wasn't able to capture a Shadow.

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:55.640
One's still here?!

00:11:55.640 --> 00:11:56.220
Miss Kasumi?

00:11:56.220 --> 00:11:59.480
All right, now! Be good
and get in this bott—

00:12:01.040 --> 00:12:03.280
Kasumi! What's wrong?

00:12:03.630 --> 00:12:06.790
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:11.610
I didn't realize there was
another detective besides me.

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:14.510
Please forget about this, my predecessor.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:19.070
That is the embodiment of my ideals.

00:12:21.290 --> 00:12:22.680
Kiiri?

00:12:22.960 --> 00:12:25.560
She used that word several times,

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:27.590
so I decided to call her that for now.

00:12:28.110 --> 00:12:31.810
She really looks just like ya, Kasumi.

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:36.300
She doesn't seem like she intends
to attack us at the moment, but...

00:12:36.700 --> 00:12:37.740
You're right.

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:42.140
All the other Shadows we've
encountered were very hostile,

00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:45.440
but this one shows no sign of that.

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:50.000
I am... a detective.

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:53.130
I must not lose heart.

00:12:53.130 --> 00:12:53.370
For my client's sake...

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:56.600
I-It's true that's what I'm thinking,
For my client's sake...

00:12:56.600 --> 00:12:57.020
I-It's true that's what I'm thinking,

00:12:57.020 --> 00:12:59.260
but I don't need everyone hearing it!

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:03.200
Good morning.

00:13:05.830 --> 00:13:07.150
She reacted?

00:13:07.150 --> 00:13:09.850
Assistant, try talking to her again!

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:11.400
Good morning!

00:13:12.430 --> 00:13:15.890
Good morning, my predecessor.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:19.070
That's amazing! You got
a reaction out of Kiiri!

00:13:19.430 --> 00:13:22.190
I have no clue why she
calls you her predecessor,

00:13:22.190 --> 00:13:25.400
but this is a big step toward learning
the truth about the Shadows!

00:13:26.430 --> 00:13:28.030
Roar!

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.480
She's scared?

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:35.550
But it's well-established that
Shadows are basically like ghosts.

00:13:35.550 --> 00:13:36.570
It's okay.

00:13:36.830 --> 00:13:38.460
Good girl. Good girl.

00:13:41.410 --> 00:13:42.760
Hmm...

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:48.520
She's clearly developed some sort of
consciousness since meeting Assistant.

00:13:50.140 --> 00:13:55.890
S-Still, even seeing her like this,
it creeps me out how identical she is to me.

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:56.950
I know!

00:13:58.100 --> 00:13:59.270
Pri-Conne

00:14:00.170 --> 00:14:04.240
There. I don't normally wear my hair
like this, so it'll be perfect.

00:14:04.520 --> 00:14:06.170
It suits you well.

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:11.450
Thank you, Great Detective.

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:15.420
Found...

00:14:18.470 --> 00:14:20.330
It's just as Kasumi suspected.

00:14:20.650 --> 00:14:25.220
This is where they showed up yesterday,
but there were more of them.

00:14:25.220 --> 00:14:28.120
They're all heading in the same direction.

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:30.650
Okay, let's follow them
without getting noticed.

00:14:34.120 --> 00:14:36.250
Go, go, go.

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:38.580
You lose, Miss Kiiri.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.640
Ready, ready, go, go, go...

00:14:40.640 --> 00:14:42.690
She's nothin' like what I
always figured Shadows were.
Ready, ready, go, go, go...

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.160
She's nothin' like what I
always figured Shadows were.

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:45.880
What a cutie.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:49.680
But why is she so different from the others?

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:52.950
What happened there yesterday...

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:56.460
That light?!

00:14:56.460 --> 00:14:57.620
Assistant, you—

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:05.370
My lord! You mustn't use
that power in a mere game!

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:06.660
Sorry.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:08.710
Ow, ow, ow...

00:15:12.170 --> 00:15:13.310
Kiiri?!

00:15:13.310 --> 00:15:15.300
Oh, my.

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:18.930
I'm so happy I met you, Great Detective.

00:15:19.560 --> 00:15:23.360
So it really was because
of Assistant's light?

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:28.310
Found... Found...

00:15:28.620 --> 00:15:29.860
This is...

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:50.530
What in the world is happening?

00:15:51.870 --> 00:15:53.220
The Shadows?

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:58.990
Yeah. They gathered around that
golem like ants swarming on honey.

00:15:58.990 --> 00:16:05.120
The golem at the mine was used when this
island was cleared for habitation,

00:16:05.120 --> 00:16:07.420
but it was s'posed to have been scrapped.

00:16:13.190 --> 00:16:14.340
That's...

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.170
What is it, Kokkoro?

00:16:22.100 --> 00:16:26.160
Nice to meet you. I am Metamorregnant.

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:31.410
It's only natural that
you would be wary of me.

00:16:31.980 --> 00:16:34.250
You can explain to them who I am.

00:16:35.640 --> 00:16:36.520
Who are you?

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:38.940
Your memories...

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:41.430
I see.

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:44.140
I saw the face of an old friend,

00:16:44.140 --> 00:16:47.530
so I thought I could ask for a favor.

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:51.140
Hang on. Isn't this a little too weird?

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:54.850
It's true that Yuuki has
lost his memories, but...

00:16:54.850 --> 00:16:56.110
It concerns...

00:16:57.210 --> 00:17:02.100
what you said earlier about the
golem the Shadows flocked to.

00:17:04.060 --> 00:17:06.470
This body is my double.

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:10.950
My real body is hiding inside that golem.

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:14.010
Those Shadows are after me,

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:16.960
since I reacted to the core.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:22.020
Forgive me for saying so, but you
and the Shadows are enemies, yes?

00:17:22.590 --> 00:17:26.480
If you free me from that swarm of Shadows,

00:17:26.480 --> 00:17:31.490
at the very least, I can promise you
will suffer no loss for it.

00:17:37.610 --> 00:17:41.140
What a shame. It seems I was a bit too late.

00:17:42.800 --> 00:17:45.920
The golem has been swallowed by the Shadows.

00:17:47.600 --> 00:17:53.300
Next, they will most likely attack the
residents of this island to reap their souls.

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:55.910
I suggest you evacuate at once.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:18:00.510
This is too sudden!
It's makin' my head spin!

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:04.180
The Shadows have attacked
other villages before!

00:18:04.180 --> 00:18:05.410
We need to get everyone out!

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:06.470
We can't.

00:18:06.470 --> 00:18:10.530
There's no boat on this island big enough
to evacuate everyone living here.

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:12.280
Oh, no...

00:18:27.010 --> 00:18:29.070
They really are coming this way...

00:18:29.070 --> 00:18:31.380
I'm actually tremblin'!

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:32.790
What's our plan?

00:18:32.790 --> 00:18:34.420
Our plan is...

00:18:35.080 --> 00:18:38.410
We fight and fight some
more to protect everyone!

00:18:39.560 --> 00:18:41.180
That's what I thought.

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:45.170
More... More... More...

00:18:45.170 --> 00:18:48.070
Princess Strike!

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:53.980
Go!

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:58.910
The swarm of Shadows is a threat, too,

00:18:58.910 --> 00:19:02.400
but if the golem smashes the wall that
protects the village, it's all over.

00:19:02.400 --> 00:19:06.540
Our first priority is to either
destroy the golem or free it.

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:07.740
Free it?

00:19:08.130 --> 00:19:09.800
Something's been bothering me.

00:19:09.800 --> 00:19:13.430
That girl who showed up yesterday
calling herself "Metamorregnant"...

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:17.360
That name is used by one of the Seven Crowns,
the seven wise ones who created

00:19:17.360 --> 00:19:19.880
the goddess Minerva,
who created this world.

00:19:20.290 --> 00:19:23.690
She might be our key to
getting out of this mess.

00:19:25.900 --> 00:19:29.060
Seriously?!

00:19:33.070 --> 00:19:36.100
Damn! We can't be careless
about going near that thing!

00:19:36.650 --> 00:19:37.830
What is this?

00:19:37.830 --> 00:19:39.680
I'm suddenly feeling more powerful.

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:41.450
Nice, Yuuki!

00:19:42.810 --> 00:19:44.750
Now I'm getting heated up!

00:19:44.750 --> 00:19:47.980
Blast through! Wolfen Bite!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:55.550
Here goes!

00:20:10.930 --> 00:20:12.740
Wind spirits!

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:18.450
Thank ya!

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.130
Down there!

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:34.580
What's that?!

00:20:34.580 --> 00:20:35.750
Oh, gross!

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:38.780
We're gonna save ya right now!

00:20:47.710 --> 00:20:49.240
Almost there...

00:20:49.990 --> 00:20:53.210
Reach out to me!

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:05.620
Damn it!

00:21:06.910 --> 00:21:08.400
Where's Miss Pecorine?!

00:21:08.690 --> 00:21:10.660
Don't give up yet!

00:21:11.920 --> 00:21:15.120
Princess Strike!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.710
Princess Strike!

00:21:24.820 --> 00:21:29.160
Princess Strike!

00:21:33.740 --> 00:21:35.210
Amazing...

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:36.420
Now we can...

00:21:37.350 --> 00:21:40.690
Princess Strike!

00:21:43.310 --> 00:21:44.690
Miss Pecorine!

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:59.760
Welcome to my Landosol Castle,

00:22:00.050 --> 00:22:02.010
Princess Eustiana.

00:23:36.970 --> 00:23:40.010
Menu 5<b> Light and Darkness as One
~Churrasco of Indecision and Resolve~</b>
